{
  "_about": "The closed vocabulary of what a source can say. Payload field form: name, or name* when required. Suffix _cents is integer cents; _on or _date is yyyy-mm-dd; units and prices are decimal strings. Sign on a txn_line is from the holder's point of view: money into the account is positive; a card charge is negative, whatever the file does. Field names follow the CDR BankingTransaction shape where one applies. super_line.line_type is one of employer, salary_sacrifice, personal_deductible, personal_after_tax, spouse, rollover_in, rollover_out, earnings, fee, insurance, contributions_tax, pension, withdrawal. A printed zero is 0; a value the source did not state is absent. Absent is never read as zero. confidence measures fidelity to the source, not whether the treatment is right. payslip.gross_cents is the printed gross, before salary sacrifice, as every Australian payslip shows it; net = gross - sacrifice - tax - post_tax + allowance + reimbursement.",
